title: psychic
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands placeholder>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "The Psychic">>
You meet a psychic seated beside the road, She studies you for a moment, her expression growing increasingly thoughtful.
Psychic: "My, my... You're carrying quite a burden, aren't you?"
She gestures for you to sit down.
Psychic: "I can see it in your eyes. Something troubles you deeply. Perhaps I can help ease your mind, if you're willing to let me."
After a moment's hesitation, you agree. The psychic settles down before you and begins her work.
Psychic: "Now, tell me... Is there something you'd rather forget? Or something you desperately wish to remember?"
-> Remember #paneldetails=Gain_1_Uncommon+_Card
    <<picture_color YarnCommands black>>
    You close your eyes and search your mind for something worth holding on to.
    Something stirs within. You reached for it, grasping at whatever it is shown in front of you.
    <<gain_uncommon_cards YarnCommands>>
    You allow memories you hold to return. Among them, you find knowledge worth keeping.
    Yet, a particular one refuses your hold, drifting away, deeper into the darkness.
-> Forget #paneldetails=Remove_1_Card_from_your_deck
    <<picture_color YarnCommands black>>
    You close your eyes and allow yourself to sink into the depths of your mind.
    You see one... shackled and bound.
    <<remove_card YarnCommands>>
    You loosen the chains that hold it captive, allowing it to drift into nothingness.
    After seeing it off, you glance down at your hand.
    [red]Pitch black.[/red]
    It seems some things you will never be able to get rid of.
<<picture_color YarnCommands white>>
You open your eyes back.
Psychic: "You seem more tranquil... and yet, I can still sense a lingering unease within you."
Psychic: "I'm afraid this is something only you can resolve."
You rise to your feet and thank the Psychic. She responds with a warm smile before bidding you farewell.
<<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
